<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel shipyard wins US$43 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Keppel shipyard wins US$43 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Shipyard, a unit of Keppel Corp Ltd, has won a US$43 million contract from U.S.-based Falcon Drilling Co to convert a vessel to a drillship, Keppel Corp said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The work on the 12,000-dwt Peregrine IV was scheduled to be completed by mid-1998, it said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
